{
  "name": "Error and Exception Handling",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9920)\n- Webhook: POST **/error**, body `{ errorId, details, retryCount?, maxRetries?, retrySafe? }`; **MPA API service credential** (Header Auth) on the Webhook node (callers send the same API key header).\n- Invalid payload: missing/empty `errorId` or `details` → logged and ignored.\n- Duplicates: `errorId` in workflow global static data.\n- Record: POST **/v1/errors/record** (2 retries, 30s apart on this node).\n- Ticket when `retrySafe === false` OR `retryCount >= maxRetries` (defaults: `retryCount=0`, `maxRetries=2`, `retrySafe=true`).\n- Retry path: POST **/v1/errors/schedule-retry** after record.\n- Ticket path: POST **/v1/admin/exception-queue/tickets** after record.\n- Workflow failure: POST **/v1/admin/team-alert** (`team: admin`, email).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "10000001-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000001",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "error",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10000002-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000002",
      "name": "Error Report Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "error-report-webhook",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "mpa-api-cred-id",
          "name": "MPA API service credential"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "miss-err-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body?.errorId ?? $json.errorId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "miss-details",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body?.details ?? $json.details }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10000003-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000003",
      "name": "Invalid Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "inv-msg",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "Ignored invalid error payload: missing errorId or details.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10000004-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000004",
      "name": "Log Invalid Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json;\nconst body = raw.body && typeof raw.body === 'object' ? raw.body : raw;\nconst errorId = String(body.errorId ?? '').trim();\nconst details = String(body.details ?? '').trim();\n\nconst staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nif (!staticData.seenErrorIds) staticData.seenErrorIds = {};\nif (staticData.seenErrorIds[errorId]) {\n  return [{ json: { errorId, details, route: 'duplicate' } }];\n}\nstaticData.seenErrorIds[errorId] = new Date().toISOString();\n\nconst retryCount = Number(body.retryCount ?? 0);\nconst maxRetries = Number(body.maxRetries ?? 2);\nconst retrySafe = body.retrySafe !== false;\nconst needsTicket = !retrySafe || retryCount >= maxRetries;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    errorId,\n    details,\n    retryCount,\n    maxRetries,\n    retrySafe,\n    needsTicket,\n    route: needsTicket ? 'ticket' : 'retry',\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "10000005-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000005",
      "name": "Route Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        380
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "dup-route",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.route }}",
              "rightValue": "duplicate",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10000006-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000006",
